  "term": "Neurontin",
  "definition": "Neurontin is a brand name for gabapentin, a synthetic substance related to the neurotransmitter GABA. It has anticonvulsant and pain-relieving effects, and it may work in part by reducing excitatory nerve activity, although its exact action is not fully known.",
